B.cw=new A.N("pillbox","Pill Box","mbedroom",0,"On her bedside table, a pill box with a compartment for every night of the week. The label reads: \u201cFor the heart. One at bedtime.\u201d Last night's is still in it.",B.N9,B.b2,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.Rh=s(["Remember.","Pupcake's birthday,","Friday. Order a bone."],t.s)
B.cm=new A.N("blotter","Blotting Pad","mbedroom",1,"The blotting pad on her dressing table. Whatever she last wrote was pressed hard, and the rubbing raises it: \u201cRemember. Pupcake's birthday, Friday. Order a bone.\u201d She was not all hard glaze.",B.iY,B.I,null,B.hq,B.Rh,!1,null)
