B.Li=new A.N("deed","Deposit Receipt","shed",3,"Folded small under a compost sack in Barry's shed: \u201cReceived from P. Cotta and B. Tart, jointly, a deposit on the Old Mill tea garden and nursery. The balance of 2,000 cubes falls due at the month end, or the deposit is forfeit.\u201d",B.qC,B.I,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
