B.KG=new A.N("candle","Fallen Candle","cellar",2,"Mrs. Senclair's candle, lying beside the outline and snuffed in its own wax where it fell. It is one of the household's hour candles, ringed in red at even spaces down its length. Four rings have burned away. The fifth has not been touched.",B.qy,B.af,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.LC=new A.N("planner","Appointment Book","study",0,"Mrs. Senclair's appointment book, kept under lock. Today's page: \u201c9 AM, the bank manager, and Sgt. Sprinkles with him. T. is not to be warned.\u201d",B.cL,B.I,"desk",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
