B.KS=new A.N("watch","Stopped Pocket Watch","cellar",0,"Mrs. Senclair's pocket watch, lying inside the outline with the glass broken. The hands stopped at 11:05 PM. The winding crown is pulled out on its stem, and there is a brown, powdery smudge on it.",B.qG,B.as,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
B.LL=new A.N("clock","Fallen Cellar Clock","cellar",3,"The old cellar clock lies face-up among the barrels with its pendulum snapped and the hands frozen at 11:05 PM. The glass door over the face hangs open, unbroken, and there is a brown, powdery fingermark on the minute hand.",B.qp,B.as,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
