B.Ls=new A.N("heelmarks","Marks on the Cellar Steps","entrance",5,"The dust on the cellar steps holds two sets of prints going down side by side: a flat slipper, and a small, sharp heel. Only the heel comes back up.",B.m3,B.bm,null,B.j,B.c,!1,null)
