B.Lc=new A.N("syrup","Poppy-Seed Syrup","kitchen",0,"A brown bottle in the cupboard, labelled in Penny's hand: \u201cPoppy-seed syrup. For coughs. ONE spoonful. Sleep follows.\u201d The level stands three fingers below her pencil mark, and a purple dribble has run down the label.",B.Nx,B.oZ,"cupboard",B.j,B.c,!1,null)
