B.NX=new A.h6("shovel","Coal Shovel","boiler",B.a14,"Barry's coal shovel, propped by the bunker. A broad blade and a long handle: just the thing for turning over loose earth. Barry watches me take it and says nothing.",B.qt,B.kF)
