B.NY=new A.h6("lockpicks","Lock Pick Box","storage",B.a1e,"A flat tin behind the dress form, stencilled \u201cCatering Corps \u2014 Larder Entry Kit\u201d. Inside, a tidy row of picks and tension wrenches. Nothing with a keyhole is safe from me now.",B.Nq,B.kF)
