B.XO=new A.aV(B.Z2,["Morning, Detective. Watch your step around the outline. ...Long John? Long John Watsonut! It's Glaze, from the old street. Well, hello! Twenty years. I never knew you had left Donut County."],t.l)
B.YJ={planner:0,tornsheet:1,chainlink:2,drizzle:3,syringesack:4,syringedirt:5,wwnote:6,wwbill:7,guestcot:8,sixthplace:9,prints:10,"accuse:2":11,"accuse:3":12}
B.a7c=new A.bZ(B.YJ,13,t.Q)
B.ahO=new A.l("what","What happened to her?","Victim is Mrs. \xc9claire Senclair, founder of Senclair Confections. One small hole, Detective, and every drop of custard drawn out of her through it, neat as you like. Whoever did this knew exactly where a pastry keeps her filling.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.ahT=new A.l("weapon","What was the weapon?","Something with a needle or a nozzle, and a plunger to pull. There'll be a pint of custard in it, wherever it is.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.ai3=new A.l("home","Who was in the house?","Five residents on your list, all home, every door latched from the inside. Funny thing, though. I'd have sworn I filled that form right across to the margin. I gave it to your partner at the door to pass to you.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.rA=s(["tornsheet"],t.s)
B.afF=new A.l("list","Is this strip torn from your list?","That's it! That's the end of my form. Six names I took down, Detective, not five: the five who live here, and the doctor who was stopping the night. I handed all six to your partner.",B.rA,B.c,null)
B.QO=s([B.ahO,B.ahT,B.ai3,B.afF,B.cS],t.q)
B.agC=new A.l("nomatch","There is a print on the weapon that is not on your chart.","Then it isn't one of the five, Detective. We printed everybody on the Sarge's list. If somebody was in this house last night and isn't on that list, I'd like to know why not.",B.aP,B.c,null)
B.QF=s([B.hK,B.hM,B.hG,B.hI,B.hF,B.agC],t.q)
B.afp=new A.l("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Strict, but fair. Her heart had been troubling her this week, and her temper with it. She'd something on her mind she wouldn't tell me.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.af3=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","I've gone round and round it, Detective, and I can't make it any of us. Everybody was somewhere. It's as if there was one more in the house than there was.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.Vc=s(["syringesack","syringedirt"],t.s)
B.af5=new A.l("syringe","This is your piping syringe.","My big one, for \xe9clairs! It was asked for at twenty to eleven, at my kitchen door. To give Madam her drops, he said. I never looked round from the oven. I thought nothing of it. He's been coming here for years.",B.Vc,B.c,null)
B.Qh=s(["penny/syringe"],t.s)
B.aeO=new A.l("doctor","Who asked you for it?","Why, the doctor. Madam's doctor. He always stops the night when her heart's bad. I couldn't tell you his name, we only ever say \u201cthe doctor\u201d. A round gentleman. Very dark. Smells of chocolate.",B.c,B.Qh,null)
B.S3=s([B.db,B.afp,B.af3,B.af5,B.aeO,B.e9,B.d2,B.eg,B.da,B.d9,B.dd,B.d4,B.cY,B.di,B.dc],t.q)
B.ahy=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","It is not a butler's place to speculate, sir. Though on this occasion I confess I cannot make the arithmetic come out.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.V7=s(["sixthplace","guestcot"],t.s)
B.ahw=new A.l("sixth","Who was the sixth at supper?","Madam's physician, sir. He dines and stays whenever her heart is troublesome. I know him only by the initials on his bag. He comes in a dressing gown and slippers by the garden door, and is gone before I am up.",B.V7,B.c,null)
B.VE=s(["wwnote","wwbill"],t.s)
B.ai4=new A.l("initials","Do the initials J. W. mean anything to you?","Not to me, sir. But Madam said them aloud on Tuesday, to herself, at her desk. She had taken to mumbling. \u201cJ. W. goes behind the lining, where he will never think to look.\u201d She had a little compartment made in that drawer years ago, sir, in the corner. I was not supposed to know of it.",B.VE,B.c,null)
B.aff=new A.l("name","Your doctor is named on this strip.","Is it indeed, sir. I had only the initials. I should not have known the gentleman in a bowler hat and a moustache. Last night he wore neither. ...Sir, I do not wish to alarm you, but he is standing directly behind you.",B.rA,B.c,null)
B.RK=s([B.nQ,B.eb,B.ahy,B.ahw,B.ai4,B.aff,B.d0,B.d3,B.d1,B.df,B.d7,B.cZ,B.dg,B.de],t.q)
B.aez=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Dashed if I know, sir. I have suspected each of them in turn since breakfast and each of them has an answer.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.SF=s(["chainlink"],t.s)
B.afX=new A.l("chain","Is this link from your monocle chain?","Mine, sir? Count them. Forty links, and not one missing. Mine is a soldier's chain, thick as bootlace. That is a fine little thing. A professional man's chain. A lawyer's. A doctor's.",B.SF,B.c,null)
B.QN=s([B.hL,B.hJ,B.aez,B.afX,B.ff,B.fe,B.jY,B.cU,B.cX,B.cV,B.ed],t.q)
B.afR=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Darling, I've no idea, and it's maddening. Usually one simply knows.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.ST=s(["drizzle"],t.s)
B.ago=new A.l("smear","Is this smear your cocoa?","Darling, look at me. I am dusted. I am not iced. That is icing, chocolate icing, the kind that drips. Nobody who lives in this house is made of that.",B.ST,B.c,null)
B.aeA=new A.l("footsteps","Did anyone pass you on the landing?","Somebody came down from the storage nook just as I picked up the telephone, darling. In slippers. I took it for Graham and didn't turn round. But Graham was at chess, wasn't he?",B.eS,B.c,null)
B.Tp=s([B.fd,B.ef,B.afR,B.ago,B.aeA,B.ec,B.eh,B.cT,B.dj],t.q)
B.ah4=new A.l("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Couldn't say, guv. I'll tell you one thing for nothin', mind. The dog never barked all night, and somebody was in and out of that garden door. So it was somebody he knows.",B.c,B.c,null)
B.VQ=s([B.fc,B.cW,B.ah4,B.dh,B.d_,B.dk,B.d5,B.d8,B.d6,B.ee],t.q)
